<title>UK: Vodafone sets 250 mln stg seven-year bond.</title>
<headline>Vodafone sets 250 mln stg seven-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers BZW and UBS.</p>
<p> BORROWER   VODAFONE GROUP PLC</p>
<p> AMT    250 MLN STG   COUPON     **	  MATURITY    19.MAR.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE   S20.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  35 BP     REOFFER    **	  SPREAD	+45 BP</p>
<p>							 S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY	A2	  LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  A+	  DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   MGT/UND    20 BP     SELL CONC   15 BP</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 6.75 PCT 2004 GILT</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
